/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Embark on an adventure through this atmospheric post-apocalyptic <strong>2.5D cinematic side-scroller</strong><br><br></li><li> Experience the <strong>main story </strong>to unravel mysteries of Earth's past <br><br></li><li> Traverse through <strong>diverse locations </strong>- dangerous islands, submerged cities, dark underwater caves, fortified enemy bases, and more<br><br></li><li> <strong>Shoot</strong> your way through the enemies or <strong>Sneak</strong> up behind them without being detected<br><br></li><li> Help troubled citizens, take up <strong>side quests</strong>, make a difference in this ruined world<br><br></li><li> Engage with NPCs in <strong>multi-branched dialogues </strong>to extract information, learn more about your mission</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Dive Hard Dave is an atmospheric action-adventure stealth game, set in a post-apocalyptic world shattered by massive tsunami and rise in sea levels. You play as Dave, a deep-sea diver who is forced into an unexpected adventure that will unravel mysteries of Earth's past. Made by a Solo Dev!",
